<title>POLAND: Poland to bid for heading OSCE in 1998.</title>
<headline>Poland to bid for heading OSCE in 1998.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The government decided on Tuesday that Poland would bid for the presidency of the Organisation for Security and Cooperation in Europe (OSCE) in 1998.</p>
<p>&quot;The European Union, the United States...and many other countries are encouraging us to officially submit our candidacy,&quot; the government said in a statement.</p>
<p>The OSCE, a pan-European security forum, is headed by Switzerland this year. Denmark is to take over in 1997.</p>
</text>
